      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "McKay Hospital, finished in November 1938, later served as a research center studying the therapeutic effects of Soap Lake’s mineral waters and climate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
